    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Mom!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> <span style="Color: Pink">buries his face in his hand, embarrassed at his mom basically giving you permission to spank him. Despite this, he can’t help but join in as you all laugh. Even <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> seems to find it amusing, meowing as he squirms out of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ hands and slips into his shirt. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Ah! Woah, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span>! Hold on!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> giggles as the cat squirms around in his clothes for a second before poking its head out of his collar and meowing again, happily snug and safe in <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ shirt as the car moves through traffic.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh my god, that is so cute!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Selina</span> coos as she glances in the rearview mirror. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>! Take photos! I need this captured!”</span> She hands you her phone and, though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> protests, the two of you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> take a few funny photos in the back to capture your first time hanging out with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ new, second-best friend. You make sure to point that out as you arrive, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> to laugh. <br>
<br>
