:: Lucas Cat Quest 3 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 15>>
You arrive at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ home and help unload the car before allowing the cat to explore. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Selina</span> sets up everything the cat needs <span style="Color: LightGreen">while you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> crawl behind <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> as he searches and sniffs around.</span> He spends a long time in the living room, discovering every little nook and hiding spot while rubbing himself on every piece of furniture, before the two of you lead him into <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ room, setting up his cat bed near <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ and trying to get him used to the area. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Lucas",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Do you think he likes it here?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> asks, sounding a tad nervous, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We tend to keep the AC low, so I hope he isn’t too chilly. Why does he keep rubbing himself on everything? Is he itchy? They said he didn’t have fleas or anything, but what if-”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> <span style="Color: Pink">works himself into a small spiral that you manage to pull him out of with a reassuring pat on the shoulder.</span> The cat looks very happy here, playfully exploring as it finds <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ backpack and begins to roll around on it playfully, causing you both to laugh. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey! Could you two help me move the cat litter?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Selina</span> calls from the other room, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s pretty heavy!”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, we’re coming!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> calls back, the two of you standing up and leaving <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> alone for a minute as you move the very heavy box of litter into a cupboard in the kitchen. It is a bit of a struggle, even with the two of you working together, and you both are utterly beat when it’s finally put away and take a minute to get a drink <span style="Color: Yellow">when you suddenly hear a crash from the other room!</span> <br>
<br>
You both burst back into his bedroom worriedly to find <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ laundry basket had been knocked over <span style="Color: Pink">and the culprit is now rolling around in a small pile of his dirty underwear, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> rubbing its face right against the crotch of his briefs! <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Lucas",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 2,
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“H- hey! Stop that!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> jumps forward, red in the face, to grab his underwear, but <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> spots him and takes off running through the house, a pair of his recently worn briefs dangled around him as he runs, eventually diving under the couch to continue its embarrassing rub. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span>! Come on, give it back!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> asks embarrassed, trying to reach in to grab his underwear. You and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Selina</span> watch on with amused laughter.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“This means he likes you, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Selina</span> says, patting her son on the shoulder, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I read that cats like to rub themselves on stuff that smell like their owners. So, him rubbing himself on your undies is a good sign.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I guess so, but it’s embarrassing…”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> replies with a pout, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Can’t he rub himself on my socks or shirts or something? I really hope this doesn’t become a habit of his.”</span> <span style="Color: Pink">You smile, you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> deciding to continue to watch <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasCat</span> play under the couch, despite <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ embarrassment of his undies being the toy. But judging by how much the cat seems to be enjoying himself, you get the feeling this isn’t the last time you’ll catch him rubbing himself on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>’ underwear.</span> <br>
